                            "speaker_hint":  "npc",
                            "speaker_hint_basis":  "character_binding_and_link_parity",
                            "EN":  "Well, a guy came to me, a stalker. He bought a lot of provisions, ammunition, equipment. He even bought a tent. It looked like he was going on a long hike. He could barely carry all this equipment on his back. So I thought to myself: I wonder why he needed so much? I figured out that he was probably getting supplies for a whole group of people. There was enough food there to last over a week.",
