                            "speaker_hint":  "npc",
                            "speaker_hint_basis":  "character_binding_and_link_parity",
                            "EN":  "We had a lot of trouble the other day. The leader of our Pathfinders, Miklukha, went missing. He was a cool stalker, almost a legendary figure. He left alone to explore the area behind the barrier and never returned. No one has seen him for a week. Our leader Lukash respected him very much, Miklukha once saved his life. So he says whoever finds Miklukha\u0027s body will get a reward. He wants to give the tracker\u0027s body to the ground, to bury it, so to speak, like a human being. If you find out where Miklukha has laid his bones, you\u0027ll get the information you need from me. Deal?",
                            "JA_current":  "We had a lot of trouble the other day. The leader of our Pathfinders, Miklukha, went missing. He was a cool stalker, almost a legendary figure. He left alone to explore the area behind the barrier and never returned. No one has seen him for a week. Our leader Lukash respected him very much, Miklukha once saved his life. So he says whoever finds Miklukha\u0027s body will get a reward. He wants to give the tracker\u0027s body to the ground, to bury it, so to speak, like a human being. If you find out where Miklukha has laid his bones, you\u0027ll get the information you need from me. Deal?",
